meta {
  name: blog categories
  type: http
  seq: 15
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/public/blogs/categories/
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  The category filter options for the blog index, with display labels. Static --
  they come from the model's choices, not the database, so a category with no
  posts still appears.

  Pass a `value` back as `?category=` on **blogs**.

  ## API example response
  {
    "success": true,
    "categories": [
      { "value": "spanish_learning_tips", "label": "Spanish Learning Tips" },
      { "value": "ecuador_travel", "label": "Ecuador Travel" },
      { "value": "school_news", "label": "School News" },
      { "value": "student_stories", "label": "Student Stories" },
      { "value": "culture_and_language", "label": "Culture & Language" }
    ]
  }
}
